cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use keryx, please cite it as below.
title: "keryx: gives Claude Code a voice"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin that speaks the gist of each reply. After every turn a hook
  hands the reply to a background daemon, a local Ollama model shortens it to one or
  two sentences about what happened and what Claude needs from you, and Kokoro-82M
  speaks them. Everything runs locally and costs no tokens.
